%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Story_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8a8e32e629c410a4c97867fa550435ab, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 43636948828160
    m_Localized: Movement Training {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43636948828161
    m_Localized: Basic Shot {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43636948828162
    m_Localized: Basic Attack Hits {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43636948828163
    m_Localized: Enemy Bullets Hit {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43636948828164
    m_Localized: Projectile Interception {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43636948828165
    m_Localized: Skill Evasion {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43636948828166
    m_Localized: Dummy Destruction {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333461598208
    m_Localized: ERIS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333520318464
    m_Localized: Verifying identity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333520318465
    m_Localized: Codename Lee On, Class K26, No mission in progress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333520318466
    m_Localized: Significant findings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512768
    m_Localized: Amputation of the right upper limb, extensive burns extending from
      the face to the shoulder, and nervous system damage have been detected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512769
    m_Localized: Access granted. Immediate first aid is highly recommended.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512770
    m_Localized: Do you have any additional requests?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512771
    m_Localized: Lee On
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512772
    m_Localized: ...R-2 Block, Cafe Vesper. All video records around 17:33 today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512773
    m_Localized: Physical function recovery rate at 79%. Neural connection for the
      right prosthetic arm has been completed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512774
    m_Localized: Per your request, the visual calibration function of the ARGUS tactical
      prosthetic eye has been linked with the prosthetic arm's motion control system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512775
    m_Localized: Additionally, the AEGIS core interface has been implanted into the
      nervous system. Upon completing adaptation training, reaction speed and control
      precision are expected to improve beyond pre-loss levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512776
    m_Localized: What about the Vesper data?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512777
    m_Localized: Most of the original records were lost due to the explosion, so
      data is being reconstructed from fragments remaining in nearby recording devices.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512778
    m_Localized: As this is expected to take some time, it is recommended to proceed
      with adaptation training while you wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512779
    m_Localized: Start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512780
    m_Localized: '[ R-2 Block Cafe Vesper. July 21st, 17:29:20 ]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512781
    m_Localized: '[ Playing back the reconstructed recording media. ]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512782
    m_Localized: "Dad, what\u2019s this box?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512783
    m_Localized: Father
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512784
    m_Localized: A patient I operated on this time gave it to me as a premium tea
      set to show gratitude, so I brought it along since it's been a while since
      I've seen my daughter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512785
    m_Localized: Is it really okay to just accept things like that from patients?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512786
    m_Localized: If we reject even their gratitude, a doctor's work would become
      too bleak, don't you think?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512787
    m_Localized: I spend hours covered in blood trying to save people... It's hard
      to understand what could possibly make people want to kill each other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512788
    m_Localized: ...Ahem. Still, wouldn't it be fine if it's someone who does terrible
      things who dies? Just like a surgery cutting away a bad tumor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512789
    m_Localized: There is nothing you won't say in front of a doctor, my dear daughter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512790
    m_Localized: But... yes. Sometimes a surgery is indeed necessary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512791
    m_Localized: "However. When it comes to saving a person, what's important is\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512792
    m_Localized: '[ The recording between 17:32:26 and 17:32:41 has been corrupted.
      ]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512793
    m_Localized: ...must.....it down... Do you understand?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512794
    m_Localized: I don't really get it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512795
    m_Localized: You're a smart girl, so I believe you'll understand someday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512796
    m_Localized: "Ah, I should try the tea I received as a gift. I'm sure you liked
      green tea\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512797
    m_Localized: '[ From 17:33:44 onwards, the recording media were destroyed by
      the explosion, and no data exists. ]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512798
    m_Localized: ...I'm here, Dad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512799
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512800
    m_Localized: I wanted to be a good person too, just like you, Dad...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512801
    m_Localized: Even if it looked a bit different... I wanted to be someone who
      saves people...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512802
    m_Localized: I couldn't even protect my loving family... I...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512803
    m_Localized: <b><color=red>I want to make a world where good people don't get
      hurt anymore.</b></color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512804
    m_Localized: Codename Lee On, after investigating Jin's data, I have finished
      analyzing the individuals who appear to be connected to the incident.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512805
    m_Localized: Should I transmit the list?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512807
    m_Localized: But... yes. Sometimes a surgery is indeed necessary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512806
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512808
    m_Localized: However. When it comes to saving a person, what's important is,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512809
    m_Localized: Not only <b><color=red>cutting away the bad tumor</b></color>, but
      putting down the knife and suturing the wound is also important.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512810
    m_Localized: I don't really get it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512811
    m_Localized: You're a smart girl, so I believe you'll understand someday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512812
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512813
    m_Localized: Should I transmit the list?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512814
    m_Localized: No...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512815
    m_Localized: Delete the list.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512816
    m_Localized: ...Understood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512817
    m_Localized: Dad. I finally understand what you meant back then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512818
    m_Localized: That cutting away the bad isn't the end, but caring for the remaining
      wounds is also necessary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512819
    m_Localized: I'm going to try and find a way to do that now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512820
    m_Localized: ...I'm leaving now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512821
    m_Localized: The video recording has ended. Please understand that while every
      effort was made to reconstruct it, some parts were lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512822
    m_Localized: ...This is enough. What is the source of the explosive?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512823
    m_Localized: As a result of backtracking the distribution channel of the components
      found in the fragments, a sales record for items of the same lineage two days
      prior to the incident was confirmed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512824
    m_Localized: The location is a black market situated in a closed subway near
      M-8 Block. The seller is <B>Salvo the Arms Dealer</B>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512825
    m_Localized: The eccentric guy rumored to ride around on those guns? What about
      the buyer?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512826
    m_Localized: They used a pseudonym, making tracking difficult. As you know, due
      to the nature of unofficial missions, there are heavy constraints on tracking
      targets whose identities are not clearly revealed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512827
    m_Localized: Is it impossible even if we pay an additional fee?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512828
    m_Localized: It is impossible. It would be possible if you personally register
      it as an official mission, but it is not recommended as the likelihood of exposure
      to the target is high. Another way is...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512829
    m_Localized: I'll have to <B><color=red>visit</B></color> Salvo directly to get
      the information.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512830
    m_Localized: Information analysis would be possible if we only secure the data,
      are you truly going to <B><color=red>visit</B></color> him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512831
    m_Localized: That's more comfortable for me. Fewer loose ends. Besides, that
      guy has crossed the line far enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512832
    m_Localized: ...And I also happen to need someone to take my anger out on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512833
    m_Localized: Confirmed. Additionally, we have been able to identify the courier
      who delivered the explosive to the hospital.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512834
    m_Localized: Who is that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512835
    m_Localized: The individual is a bulky mercenary named <B>Ram</B>, and because
      they are equipped with high-output physical enhancement gear, they were not
      difficult to identify.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512836
    m_Localized: However, similarly, we could not track down who commissioned them
      to move the explosive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512837
    m_Localized: I'll have to <B><Color=red>visit</B></Color> that guy directly as
      well. Do you know where he is currently located?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512838
    m_Localized: Please wait. I will register the relevant data on the panel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512839
    m_Localized: Verifying identity. Codename Lee On. Welcome back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512840
    m_Localized: The data you acquired has already been nearly completely analyzed.
      Do you have any questions?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512841
    m_Localized: The purpose of the bomb's delivery. I want to know why my dad had
      to die.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512842
    m_Localized: The reason is simple. The explosion at Vesper was an accident.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512843
    m_Localized: ...What?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512844
    m_Localized: As a result of investigating Ram's terminal, the elimination target
      was the original recipient of the gift, meaning the patient your father was
      treating.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512845
    m_Localized: The individual is presumed to be an accountant for the Syndicate,
      an organization that manages the distribution of weapons, information, and
      funds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512846
    m_Localized: Circumstantially, the explosive being delivered to your father was
      an unplanned variable; originally, it appears they intended to detonate it
      at the target's residence and disguise it as a gas accident.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512847
    m_Localized: Then... where is that person now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512848
    m_Localized: The day after the Vesper accident, he was found suicidal at home.
      After analyzing the relevant data, it is predicted that <B>Mirage</B> has <B><color=red>visited</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512849
    m_Localized: <B>Mirage</B>.. is it the one who disappears in front of you and
      suddenly appears and stabs you in the back?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512850
    m_Localized: Although the estimated location of <B>Mirage</B> currently registered
      in the database exists... please understand that it cannot be provided unless
      it is registered as an official mission.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512851
    m_Localized: No need for that. If I loiter around that accountant's house, he'll
      come to <b><color=red>visit</b></color> me on his own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512852
    m_Localized: Confirmed. Also, separately, we have identified some individuals
      connected to the incident through Salvo's transaction history.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512853
    m_Localized: Must be people from the Syndicate side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512854
    m_Localized: Correct. The person who led the operation is <B>Canon</B>, and the
      person who made the final decision is someone named Jin, who is presumed to
      be part of the Syndicate's executive leadership.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512855
    m_Localized: Canon? That person belongs to the underworld?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512856
    m_Localized: Publicly, they active as an artist combining music and drone performances,
      but in reality, they appear to belong to the Syndicate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512857
    m_Localized: Jin's location cannot be specified, but since there is a lot of
      known information about Canon they were easily pinpointed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512858
    m_Localized: However, since we also maintain a collaborative relationship with
      the Syndicate, it will be difficult to grant you accommodations if you <b><color=red>visit</b></color>
      the related individual without going through proper procedures.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512859
    m_Localized: Will you still proceed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512860
    m_Localized: If I had cared about profits, I would have washed my hands of this,
      but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512861
    m_Localized: <b><color=red>This is a strictly personal revenge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512862
    m_Localized: Confirmed. Before you depart, please check as we have expanded the
      available modules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512863
    m_Localized: Verifying identity. Codename Lee On. Welcome back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512864
    m_Localized: There are two pieces of information that have currently been analyzed.
      Borrowing an idiomatic expression, it is good news and bad news. Which side
      would you like to hear first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512865
    m_Localized: ...Tell me one by one. I'll judge after I listen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512866
    m_Localized: First then, as a result of analyzing the devices of those who were
      commissioned, we were able to pinpoint Jin's current location and movement
      patterns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512867
    m_Localized: And the bad news?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512868
    m_Localized: Not long ago, a new mission was registered under the name of the
      client, Jin. Visitor codename ECHO.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512869
    m_Localized: The target of the visit. Codename Lee On, it is you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512870
    m_Localized: That bastard must have caught wind of it. Echo.. of all people,
      he brought the most troublesome opponent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512871
    m_Localized: By the way, ERIS. If it has been designated as an official mission,
      you have no reason to take my side anymore, so why are you informing me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512872
    m_Localized: To explain it simply, it is a sort of investment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512873
    m_Localized: An investment?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512874
    m_Localized: As you know, we adjust the balance of society through visits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512875
    m_Localized: However, those who move according to profit are bound to have their
      judgment clouded and eventually become corrupt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512876
    m_Localized: On the other hand, those who move with a <b><color=red>consistent
      motivation</b></color> as their driving force rather than profit become a pure
      and predictable engine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512877
    m_Localized: Therefore, it is judged that helping you, Lee On, to continue your
      visits is beneficial to society as a whole.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512878
    m_Localized: ...I see. Then to what extent can you support me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512879
    m_Localized: I have registered Jin's location on the panel. It is recommended
      that you visit him first before codename Echo arrives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512880
    m_Localized: The locations of the individuals whose identities have been specified
      have been registered on the tactical panel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512881
    m_Localized: Through the tactical panel, you can check the target's information
      and move to the corresponding location
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512882
    m_Localized: When you access the panel, the following interface will be displayed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512883
    m_Localized: <B><color=red>Visit</B></color> the desired target and secure the
      data. As soon as valid data is secured, we will analyze it immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512884
    m_Localized: Even if it is a target you have already completed a <b><color=red>visit</b></color>
      to, it is possible to record that individual's data and engage in battle repeatedly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512885
    m_Localized: If you achieve additional conditions, you can secure more battle
      data in addition to the incident data to be analyzed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512886
    m_Localized: Since the collected data chips are subsequently used for module
      expansion to improve equipment performance, it is recommended to prioritize
      securing data chips if the battle is challenging.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512887
    m_Localized: Now that you have secured a certain amount of battle data chips,
      I will explain the module expansion function.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512888
    m_Localized: By accessing the corresponding module panel, you can improve the
      performance of your implanted equipment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512889
    m_Localized: When you access the panel, the following interface will be displayed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512890
    m_Localized: You can consume the battle data chips you possess to expand and
      equip the modules you want.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512891
    m_Localized: Expanded modules can be changed freely, but please note that modules
      of the same type cannot be equipped duplicate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333528707072
    m_Localized: You can also refund selected modules back into data chips, so if
      a battle is challenging, it is recommended to utilize various module combinations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901376
    m_Localized: Commencing equipment adaptation training.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901377
    m_Localized: First, we will verify whether the equipment implantation has caused
      any adverse effects on your nervous system. Please move forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901378
    m_Localized: Movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901379
    m_Localized: Press the <sprite name="icon_w"><sprite name="icon_a"><sprite name="icon_s"><sprite
      name="icon_d"> keys to move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901380
    m_Localized: Movement normal. No significant findings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901381
    m_Localized: Next, we will measure the impact of momentary shock. Please fire
      the gun held in your left hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901382
    m_Localized: Basic Attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901383
    m_Localized: <sprite name="icon_leftclick"> to fire a bullet-type energy core
      in the direction of the cursor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901384
    m_Localized: Recoil control and posture calibration normal. No abnormalities
      in the physical balance system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901385
    m_Localized: Opening the front bulkhead. Please advance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901386
    m_Localized: Next is adaptation training utilizing dummy targets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901387
    m_Localized: First, let's test a module that automatically calibrates its aim
      to adversarial objects. Shoot anywhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901388
    m_Localized: Aim calibration module normal. This module can be removed later
      if it becomes unnecessary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901389
    m_Localized: Next, we will check the operation of the AEGIS interface through
      the dummy's suppression rounds. The core has been resupplied, so please stand
      in the line of fire of the dummy's attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901390
    m_Localized: Wait, I just had surgery?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901391
    m_Localized: The AEGIS system is an important function that consumes the core
      at the time of attack to momentarily block fatal damage, and we will check
      it in advance for safety.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901392
    m_Localized: Taking Damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901393
    m_Localized: 'When hit by an enemy attack, a bullet-type energy core is consumed
      first to absorb the damage.


      If you take damage while possessing zero
      cores, it will result in death.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901394
    m_Localized: AEGIS system normal. Please note that while physical damage can
      be neutralized, the shock and pain cannot be mitigated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901395
    m_Localized: I know...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901396
    m_Localized: Additionally, please be extremely cautious, as the AEGIS system
      will not function if there are no bullet-type energy cores available to block
      the attack, which may result in fatal injury.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901397
    m_Localized: Next is training utilizing the ARGUS tactical prosthetic eye and
      the prosthetic arm's motion control system. Try to intercept the bullets fired
      by the dummy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901398
    m_Localized: Interception
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901399
    m_Localized: '<sprite name="icon_rightclick"> to capture enemy projectiles with
      the ARGUS eye, allowing your prosthetic arm to automatically intercept them.


      A
      successful intercept neutralizes the attack and automatically absorbs its energy
      into the core.


      Failing multiple intercepts in a short time strains
      the ARGUS eye, gradually reducing its capture range.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901400
    m_Localized: Intercepting is the only way to replenish bullet-type energy cores
      during combat. Please note that some projectiles cannot be intercepted depending
      on their type.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901401
    m_Localized: Next is the explanation regarding Overload. Energy cores continuously
      release energy to maintain the AEGIS system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901403
    m_Localized: Overload
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901404
    m_Localized: 'Bullet-type energy cores will overload and be automatically discharged
      if held for too long.


      The ammo icon in the magazine indicates the time
      remaining until overload.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901405
    m_Localized: Next is Active Skill. You can recycle a portion of the energy released
      by the core to use it as a momentary enhancement of physical capability.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901406
    m_Localized: Active Skill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901407
    m_Localized: 'Press the <sprite name="icon_space"> to use a active skill.


      Active
      Skills have a cooldown and can be used again after a certain time.


      The
      skill gauge around the magazine indicates when the skill is ready to use.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901408
    m_Localized: Try to dodge the enemy attack using the Tactical Dodge skill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901409
    m_Localized: The basic training for the implanted equipment has concluded. Lastly,
      we will conduct a mock battle with an enemy dummy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901410
    m_Localized: Utilize attack, interception, and active skill appropriately to
      destroy the dummy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901411
    m_Localized: Adaptation training concluded. Information updated. Adjusting the
      physical capability information of Codename Lee On upward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901412
    m_Localized: The data analysis related to Cafe Vesper is 98% complete. Please
      return to the lobby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901413
    m_Localized: Tactical dodge failed. Please try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901414
    m_Localized: Perform the tactical dodge right before making contact with the
      bullet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901415
    m_Localized: All bullet-type energy cores have been depleted; resupplying now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43636894302208
    m_Localized: They probably already know I'm coming and are waiting for me along
      with Echo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901402
    m_Localized: If the same core is not consumed for a long time, it will overload
      and be automatically discharged, as it can inflict thermal damage to the user.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 739306561925120
    m_Localized: In addition, the bullet-type energy core displayed on the magazine
      is consumed when shooting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1108486769008640
    m_Localized: '[ Objective ]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1345961062363136
    m_Localized: That's a reasonable guess, then I recommend you check the module
      for the last time before combat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1424586970947584
    m_Localized: However, the reason they were designated as an elimination target
      has not been confirmed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1826406394068992
    m_Localized: Core Interrupt {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1826406452789248
    m_Localized: Lastly, this is core Interrupt training.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1826406452789249
    m_Localized: When bosses prepare a powerful attack, there are times when a blue
      energy core is revealed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1826406452789250
    m_Localized: Intercepting that core will not only stun the boss but also generate
      extra energy, so utilizing this can lead the battle to your advantage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1826406452789251
    m_Localized: Core Interrupt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1826406452789252
    m_Localized: 'A blue energy core is generated when the boss prepares a powerful
      attack.


      Intercepting that core stuns the boss and generates extra energy
      around them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2147990514270208
    m_Localized: Training Area
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
